  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "22ce2a45-3b71-4aea-bc15-d445f8c7c367",
      "name": "Main Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        10944,
        4032
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 380,
        "height": 972,
        "content": "## Automated AI News Curator & LinkedIn Publisher\n\nAutomate your personal branding! This workflow searches for daily tech news, uses AI to write a viral LinkedIn post with a generated image, and asks for your approval on Slack before publishing.\n\n### HOW IT WORKS\n1. **Daily Scheduling**: Triggers daily and assigns a unique topic based on the day of the week.\n2. **News Scraping**: Fetches the latest articles matching the daily topic using the NewsData API.\n3. **AI Curation**: A Gemini AI agent evaluates the articles and selects the most engaging piece.\n4. **Deep Reading**: Uses Jina AI to scrape the full content of the selected article.\n5. **Post & Image Generation**: Gemini writes a highly engaging LinkedIn post and generates a matching AI image prompt.\n6. **Human Approval**: Pauses execution and sends the draft to Slack for your approval.\n7. **Publishing**: If approved, attaches the image and publishes automatically to LinkedIn.\n\n### HOW TO SET UP\n- **NewsData.io**: Add your API key in the HTTP Request node.\n- **Google Gemini**: Connect your Gemini (PaLM) API for text and image generation.\n- **Jina AI**: Add your Jina Reader API key in the Authorization header.\n- **Slack**: Connect your Slack API to receive approval messages.\n- **LinkedIn**: Connect your LinkedIn credentials for publishing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
